{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264YMElwmbmR1792709211.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國十年期國債孳息率近一個月以來首次跌穿5厘，跌至4.96厘。而5年至30年期國債孳息率均跌至近一個月低位。各期限美國國債孳息率最多跌16個基點。</p><p></p><p>星展認為，隨著投資者重新評估人工智能資產，近期市場情緒欠缺方向，美國國債孳息率按近期標準而言仍處於高位，投資者或希望透過買入美債避險，用作對沖部分風險。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:40:03.617564+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:21.069835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:37:54.786169+00:00","content_hash":"781d1f7e7fdd8fbfa36ea6e7922f44e6b5347627d024d0bf7008e4dfd27b8e12","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:40:03.617564+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}